After the makeup pics… and some nonsense…. It gets a little real. There’s a CT scan report from my first time with this recurrent issue. I was inpatient at the hospital, with “opacified” sinuses, with fungal involvement. Thus began my personal hell with my sinuses and lungs at the hands of my disease. 

I’m posting again- to ask for help- because as this is going on, I am uninsured, awaiting my appeal to be approved (thankfully after that I’m supposed to get reimbursed for my out of pocket costs )

I just got over the hump with the help of some kind imgurians for my rat boys who had mites.    I feel embarrassed and ashamed to be in this position. With the gradual decline in my wellbeing, and the one bit of sanity hanging on by the thread that is my rats…. I just have to try, push forward, not give up. 

I’ve tried to give up on life twice and I cannot do it again. 

